<title>JAPAN: BOJ to brief reporters on meeting with Thai banker.</title>
<headline>BOJ to brief reporters on meeting with Thai banker.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Japan (BOJ) will hold a news briefing at 5.15 p.m. (0815 GMT) on Thursday to discuss details of BOJ governor Yasuo Matsushita's meeting with Thai central bank governor Rerngchai Marakanond, the BOJ said in a statement.</p>
<p>The two central bank governors met earlier on Thursday to discuss the economic situation and currency movements.</p>
